    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3 BEDROOM APARTMENT \r\nPerfectly positioned in sought after area of Portnablagh, Apartment 2 at Killahoey Apartments offers an outstanding opportunity to acquire a beautifully located three-bedroom ground floor apartment overlooking the magnificent Killahoey Beach and the sparkling waters of Sheephaven Bay. Designed to make the most of its exceptional coastal setting, the apartment features a bright and spacious open-plan kitchen, living and dining area, creating a welcoming space for both everyday living and entertaining. Large windows frame the stunning sea views, allowing natural light to flood the living accommodation while providing a constantly changing backdrop of beach, bay and coastline.\r\nACCOMMODATION: \r\nKitchen/Living/Dining Room, Three Bedrooms (1 Ensuite) Bathroom"
      },
